<key>NSAccessibilityUsageDescription</key><string>Sayqalchi reads the entire focused draft and converts all its paragraphs to the new Uzbek letters when you accept a suggestion. Formatting stays on your Mac. Only your default service runs after a typing pause. Other services run when you open their tab. Translation sends the draft to your selected public provider or custom service; Izohchi sends the selected word or word at the cursor to Izoh.uz.</string>
<key>LSApplicationCategoryType</key><string>public.app-category.productivity</string>
<key>NSHumanReadableCopyright</key><string>Sayqalchi 2026. Independent app inspired by Echo. Not affiliated with VoiceLab.</string>
